Package: CCAflow
Type: Package
Title: Integrated Canonical Correlation and Multiview Association Workflows
Version: 0.1.1
Date: 2026-09-17
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = c("Walter", "Esfrain"), family = "Pereira",
           email = "walterufpb@yahoo.com.br", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1085-0191"))
    )
Description: Provides an integrated workflow for canonical correlation analysis
    and modern multiview association methods. Core functionality includes
    classical, ridge, shrinkage, sparse, robust, rank, copula and kernel
    canonical correlation analysis; canonical coefficients, structure
    coefficients, cross-loadings, variance extracted and redundancy;
    inferential, bootstrap, permutation, stability, cross-validation and nested
    resampling tools; functional, dynamic, repeated-measures and multiway
    helpers; adapters for mixed-data, multiblock, Bayesian and deep canonical
    correlation engines; and publication-ready tables, graphics and educational
    projection tours. The package deliberately separates in-sample association,
    statistical inference, resampling stability and out-of-sample generalization.
